      "title": "Jobs",
      "subtitle": "Xogħlijiet — what people do for a living",
      "intro": "Maltese job words change for gender and number. The masculine is the base form; the feminine usually adds -a (tabib → tabiba); the plural is often a broken plural (tabib → tobba).",
